Subject: [PATCH] meson: apply the install prefix to daemon logrotate files

Upstream commit f739d43ee6 moved daemon logrotate installation into
src/meson.build. Extend the Nix install-prefix handling to this location
so installation stays inside the package output instead of writing to /var.

--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -300,7 +300,7 @@
   )
   install_data(
     daemon_logrotate,
-    install_dir: sysconfdir / 'logrotate.d',
+    install_dir: install_prefix + sysconfdir / 'logrotate.d',
     rename: [ daemon['name'] ],
   )
 endforeach
